##### Sets

- $I = \{S1, S2, S3, S4, S5, S6\}$: Suppliers  
- $J = \{C1, C2, C3, C4, C5, C6\}$: Stores

##### Parameters

- $f_i$: Fixed cost to open supplier $i$
    - $f_{S1} = 98.88$
