    - $f_{S6} = 112.65$
- $c_{ij}$: Transportation cost per unit from supplier $i$ to store $j$ (see table below)
- $d_j$: Demand at store $j$
    - $d_{C1} = 216$
    - $d_{C2} = 216$
    - $d_{C3} = 216$
    - $d_{C4} = 144$
